.com/id/shushengshop/", "num_games_owned": 1190, "num_reviews": 126, "playtime_forever": 353, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 353, "last_played": 1719643823, "avatar": "ee5cc428258a2f7f5775ae66f8bbcde744738e44"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "有朋友和你一起玩才是最大的乐趣。\n小手一指，尸潮开始，小腿一蹭，沉睡启动。不是绝望打不起，而是队友一秒一告密，给他一个跑图的机会，他能用肉身排遍所有的沉睡，再给他一个开枪的机会，他能枪枪打到所有报警。美国五星上将麦克阿瑟曾经说过，如果让我和队友一起做清理者，我就知道，这逞凶好斗算是带对了，此话一出，迅速引起社会各界广泛关注，大型纪录片《人形告密者》，持续为您播出！！！\n", "timestamp_created": 1727673979, "timestamp_updated": 1727673979, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.606908857822418213", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 4}, {"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}]}]}